[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12600.309, "timestamp": "03:30:00", "text": "我早上8点到9点才睡觉。我以前"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12602.79, "timestamp": "03:30:02", "text": "经常这样熬夜，晚上"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12607.429, "timestamp": "03:30:07", "text": "6点半左右就醒了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12612.469, "timestamp": "03:30:12", "text": "吃完晚饭我就来直播。 一直都是这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12616.389, "timestamp": "03:30:16", "text": "。 我最近的睡眠时间有点乱"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12622.55, "timestamp": "03:30:22", "text": "。 我一直在忙网站"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12625.75, "timestamp": "03:30:25", "text": "相关的工作。 所以我就想，“是啊，我还没"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12627.75, "timestamp": "03:30:27", "text": "直播过游戏，那我就"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12629.67, "timestamp": "03:30:29", "text": "直播一次游戏吧。”   是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12632.55, "timestamp": "03:30:32", "text": "。 呃呃，故事是这样的，你本来应该"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12635.349, "timestamp": "03:30:35", "text": "和你的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12638.389, "timestamp": "03:30:38", "text": "朋友或者你自己一起去度假，但是飞机"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12641.429, "timestamp": "03:30:41", "text": "坠毁在一个岛上。 所以，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12646.469, "timestamp": "03:30:46", "text": "必须到达顶峰。 呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12649.51, "timestamp": "03:30:49", "text": "，一共大概有四张地图。 第一个是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12656.15, "timestamp": "03:30:56", "text": "……热带岛屿。 不是热带的，嗯，就是那种到处都是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12658.229, "timestamp": "03:30:58", "text": "沙子的普通岛屿"}]